{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"40f6f23e99aa49e98b4b5e2b811549d3","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"808fc783a9e6da4b95a8b4ba45ee462589a8","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=808fc783a9e6da4b95a8b4ba45ee462589a8","view_num":720,"pub_timestamp":"1705917362","title":"1월 25일 신규 추가 콘텐츠 안내(1/24 수정)","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=808fc783a9e6da4b95a8b4ba45ee462589a8","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1. 신규 캐릭터\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.1\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[목단]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e뒷\u0026nbsp;세계의\u0026nbsp;소규모\u0026nbsp;정예\u0026nbsp;조직\u0026nbsp;'모란회'\u0026nbsp;보스,\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[목단]이\u0026nbsp;전장에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e목단은\u0026nbsp;체력을\u0026nbsp;잃을\u0026nbsp;수록\u0026nbsp;방어능력이\u0026nbsp;상승하는\u0026nbsp;니케입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e끊임없이\u0026nbsp;적을\u0026nbsp;도발하고\u0026nbsp;일정\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;이하가\u0026nbsp;될\u0026nbsp;때\u0026nbsp;마다\u0026nbsp;자신의\u0026nbsp;체력을\u0026nbsp;증가시켜\u0026nbsp;생존합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;방어형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;드래곤\u0026nbsp;헤드(AR)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;전격\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;테트라\u0026nbsp;라인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[목단]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;[목단]을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;업데이트를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;[목단]은\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.1\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;슈가-와일드\u0026nbsp;백야드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e어둠의\u0026nbsp;세계에서\u0026nbsp;활동하던\u0026nbsp;시절,\u0026nbsp;그녀가\u0026nbsp;애용하던\u0026nbsp;복장.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[슈가-와일드\u0026nbsp;백야드]는\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;Mission\u0026nbsp;Pass에서\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;MissionPass에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;안내는\u0026nbsp;아래\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;안내에서\u0026nbsp;확인하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.1\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;DIRTY\u0026nbsp;BACKYARD\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e아우터\u0026nbsp;림의\u0026nbsp;포그\u0026nbsp;할로우에서\u0026nbsp;일어난\u0026nbsp;살인\u0026nbsp;사건의\u0026nbsp;범인으로\u0026nbsp;지목되어\u0026nbsp;누명을\u0026nbsp;쓰게\u0026nbsp;되는\u0026nbsp;목단.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e그로\u0026nbsp;인해\u0026nbsp;아우터\u0026nbsp;림에서의\u0026nbsp;평판이\u0026nbsp;바닥을\u0026nbsp;치고,\u0026nbsp;언더월드\u0026nbsp;퀸에서의\u0026nbsp;입지\u0026nbsp;또한\u0026nbsp;흔들리게\u0026nbsp;된다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e이에\u0026nbsp;사건을\u0026nbsp;해결하고\u0026nbsp;목단의\u0026nbsp;누명을\u0026nbsp;벗기기\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;해결사\u0026nbsp;슈가의\u0026nbsp;도움을\u0026nbsp;받게\u0026nbsp;되고,\u0026nbsp;진상\u0026nbsp;파악을\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;포그\u0026nbsp;할로우로\u0026nbsp;향한다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003eDIRTY\u0026nbsp;BACKYARD\u0026nbsp;이벤트에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;획득하고\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;다양한\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점의\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;교환은\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;종료됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지]가\u0026nbsp;DIRTY\u0026nbsp;BACKYARD에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;도전하여\u0026nbsp;각종\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득해\u0026nbsp;보세요!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.2\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;Days\u0026nbsp;Login\u0026nbsp;이벤트-PASSIONATE\u0026nbsp;PEONY\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;매일\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하여\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;7일까지\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;로그인\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.3\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003eD-OUTSIDERS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;D-OUTSIDERS이\u0026nbsp;아카이브에\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;DIRTY\u0026nbsp;BACKYARD에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트를\u0026nbsp;해금할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;[메모리\u0026nbsp;필름]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e지휘관\u0026nbsp;5명이\u0026nbsp;협동하여\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;[토커티브\u0026nbsp;[H.S.T.A.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;도전합니다.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전은\u0026nbsp;친구나\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버\u0026nbsp;혹은\u0026nbsp;자동\u0026nbsp;매칭을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;도전이\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;처치하여\u0026nbsp;획득한\u0026nbsp;부서진\u0026nbsp;코어는\u0026nbsp;고철\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;쥬얼,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e* 이벤트 진행 기간: 2024년 2월 2일 12:00:00 ~ 2024년 2월 4일 23:59:59 (UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;참여\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5.1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;패키지가\u0026nbsp;갱신됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*판매\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;28일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e상세한\u0026nbsp;정보는\u0026nbsp;[로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;패키지]에서\u0026nbsp;확인하여\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5.2\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;Mission\u0026nbsp;Pass\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;1일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e0:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2월\u0026nbsp;프리미엄\u0026nbsp;패스\u0026nbsp;구매\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;일일\u0026nbsp;미션을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;Pass\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;레벨을\u0026nbsp;달성하면\u0026nbsp;슈가의\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;[와일드\u0026nbsp;백야드]를\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e감사합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e《승리의\u0026nbsp;여신:\u0026nbsp;니케》\u0026nbsp;운영진\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_d99ff67bfbfd70d3e88876db97f3ca634647a32a-1920x1080-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"1월 25일 신규 추가 콘텐츠 안내(1/24 수정)","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"1. 신규 캐릭터\n1.1 SSR 니케 [목단]\n뒷 세계의 소규모 정예 조직 '모란회' 보스, SSR 니케 [목단]이 전장에 합류합니다.\n목단은 체력을 잃을 수록 방어능력이 상승하는 니케입니다.\n끊임없이 적을 도발하고 일정 체력 이하가 될 때 마다 자신의 체력을 증가시켜 생존합니다.\n- 클래스: 방어형\n- 무기: 드래곤 헤드(AR) \n- 코드: 전격\n- 기업: 테트라 라인\n*특수 모집 기간: 2024년 1월 25일 12:00:00 ~ 2024년 2월 8일 4:59:59 (UTC+9)\n*획득처: 로비 화면 → 대원 모집 → 특수 모집\n*모집 안내:\n①쥬얼(무료/유료) 사용 및 고급 모집 티켓으로 특수 모집을 진행할 수 있습니다. (일반 모집 티켓은 사용할 수 없습니다.)\n②특수 모집의 경우 SSR 니케 획득 확률은 4%이며, 그중 SSR [목단]의 획득 확률은 2%입니다.\n③특수 모집 진행 시, 골드 마일리지 티켓을 획득할 수 있습니다.\n④200개의 골드 마일리지 티켓을 모아 마일리지 ","language":"ko","father_content_id":"808fc783a9e6da4b95a8b4ba45ee462589a8","result":0}}